{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咦？今天小乾请假？”", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0586", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，这么说来她早上也没来社团。”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁也没有在校门口看见小纱同学。”", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "ag3427", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结果，昨天纱凪没有回社团教室。", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是濑名同学来了，她说纱凪身体突然不舒服。", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以后来是濑名同学把美羽带去纱凪的家。", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没事吧……打电话给她看看吧？”", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不需要担心。是感冒啦，感冒。她现在一定在睡觉，打电话过去只会吵到她。”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "ar4400", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“最近天气变冷了嘛～”", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0587", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我家的地板也冷得夸张。”", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小乾的家怎么样？果然是那种地暖系统完善的大豪宅？”", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0588", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不知道欸，纱凪也是大小姐……吗？”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁觉得那种神秘的部分对女孩子来说是很重要的。”", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "ag3428", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“全身上下都很神秘的女仆都这样说了，一定不会错。”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0589", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呵呵呵，因为女仆只会在未来的主人面前展现出自己的全部喔。”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "ag3429", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这个嘛～找不到吧？安洁的主人……”", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0590", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“隼太同学，你是叫安洁去死吗？”", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "ag3430", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我没有要把你逼到绝境的意思啦。”", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0591", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管怎么说，我还是很担心纱凪的缺席。", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那么大家轮流帮她抄上课笔记吧？期末考也快到了……”", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好喔，我排第一个吧，下午好像会打瞌睡。”", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0592", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“女生的健康教育课就交给安洁。”", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "ag3431", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“剩下的就由我跟濑名同学分担可以吧？”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我一个人抄就好了，你不用。”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "ar4401", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么可以，只有我不帮忙心里也会怪怪的。”", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你帮忙的话，会惹纱凪不开心吧。”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "ar4402", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔……”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾还没有让小乾接受你啊？”", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0593", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“隼太不是吗？”", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈哈，她连眼神都不跟我对上。”", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0594", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "哈哈，笑不出来。", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小纱凪果然请假了啊……打电话给她也没接，我好担心。”", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1369", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“濑名同学说好像是感冒。昨天她没回社团也是这个原因。”", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没事吧……小纱凪常常会逞强。”", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1370", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学姐不也是吗？”", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我已经反省过了，不会再逞强了喔。”", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1371", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“之前还因此给新吾君和小樱乃添了麻烦……”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1372", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐下意识地伸出手想牵我，但是突然意识到自己的动作而收了回去。", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……感觉好像会上瘾呢。”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1373", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟喜欢的人牵手。”", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1374", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐小声地说，然后俏皮地吐舌头。", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想到那种不分场合大马路上放闪的情侣，好像稍微能理解他们的心情了。", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "每当和学姐说话，我就想要尽可能地与她肢体接触。", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "旁人的视线都无所谓了。", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉喔，来找你了……”", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1375", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……下次换我去三年级的教室吧？”", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那样不行～”", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1376", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么？”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“三年级没有和各务台学园的试验班，全部都是女孩子。”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1377", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾君去那种地方的话，你觉得会怎么样？”", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1378", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……呃？”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“大家都因为烦恼升学就业的事情累积了很多压力，要是出现了年轻男孩子的话……”", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1379", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔，接下来的事情我说不出口……”", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1380", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我突然有点想恶作剧一下逼她说出口。", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "真是新奇，学姐居然会说这种话……", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔～新吾你在这啊。接下来是体育课，差不多该去换衣服了喔～”", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0595", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好，知道了。”", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“天羽学姐好～”", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0596", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1381", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咦？我脸上有沾到什么吗？”", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0597", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，没有，什么都没有。新吾君，待会见啰！”", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1382", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好，待会见。”", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“椋梨君待会见……没有说欸。”", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0598", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听着隼太的喃喃自语，我向学姐挥手道别。", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……？”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0599", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好，我们去换衣服吧……”", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“等等，换衣服前麻烦你详细解释一下。”", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0600", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“详细解释？”", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……唔！？”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太突然搭上我的肩膀，还对我的肚子灌了一拳。", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你跟天羽学姐是不是发生了什么？”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0601", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什、什么都没有啊。”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不管，给我老实说！什么都没有的男女会笑着挥手说再见吗？”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0602", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟美羽学姐的关系被怀疑了。", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过对隼太也没有必要刻意隐瞒。", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也希望班上能至少有一个理解我的人。", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那你可以保证不会对任何人说吗？”", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么，你在跟天羽学姐交往吗？”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0603", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我什么都还没说啊。”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“一般人都猜得到吧，看到你们那种互动。”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0604", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们的情侣关系真的有那么明显吗？", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不注意一点的话，会被大家看穿的。", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“居然是跟那个天羽学姐啊……”", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0605", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“果然很不相配吧？我跟美羽学姐……”", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有那种事吧？新吾你很适合那种姐姐类型的女生喔。”", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0606", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是吗？”", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你不太会依赖别人对吧？所以至少女朋友要选能撒娇的对象。”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0607", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且天羽学姐好像会很宠你的感觉～”", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0608", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个，呃……”", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我自己是希望她能对我撒娇啦，不过考虑到学姐的个性……", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘可是……我对新吾君，好像会做出可能把你弄坏的各种事情……’", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1383", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不知道这种状况是不是该高兴。", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之，这件事不要告诉大家……”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我知道啦。我会一边偷笑一边温馨地旁观你们的。”", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0609", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真是糟糕的兴趣。”", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，你要小心点喔。”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0610", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小心点？”", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“笨蛋，你稍微冷静思考看看。”", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0611", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“像天羽学姐这样博爱主义的人，至今为止都对动物一视同仁地灌注爱情。”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0612", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那种深不见底的爱情现在全部都灌注在你身上了喔？”", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0613", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我很担心你啊新吾。你能承受得了那个人全力放送的爱的电流吗？”", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0614", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“应该会强得让人麻痹吧。”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“在被麻痹之前先麻痹她！”", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0615", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太用力地一掌拍在我的背上。", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过，你就算交了女朋友也要偶尔跟我出去玩喔～”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0616", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这当然，我也是这么希望的。”", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说，还要看天羽学姐同不同意啦。”", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0617", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐的话会同意的。”", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是吗？她那种类型感觉意外地会忌妒恋人的朋友喔～”", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0618", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "目前为止，我还没有感觉到学姐有那种情绪。", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "反而她完全不忌妒还比较让我不安。", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之就是这样啦。”", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0619", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“恭喜你。”", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "ht0620", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咕呼！？”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "腹部又被灌了一拳，疼痛与喜悦参半。", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样啊。原来椋梨君注意到了我们的关系。”", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1384", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，我收到他的祝福外加两拳了。”", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼呼。真好呢，有能聊那种话的朋友。”", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1385", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜～噜～”", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "pn0374", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放学后，社团教室里只有我们两人，美羽学姐变成只属于我的恋人。", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她突然牵我的手时，我忍不住雀跃了起来。", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐真的好娇小，只要她在身边我就想抱住她。", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我觉得被同性也仰慕的人真的很棒呢～”", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1386", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐不也是这样吗？”", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有喔～我就没有能够聊新吾君的事的朋友。”", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1387", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是学姐给人会收到很多女孩子送的情人节巧克力的印象……”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为一直念女校吧。大家常常会交换巧克力。”", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1388", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“顺便问一下，学姐收过多少个巧克力呢？”", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这个……大约５０个左右吧。”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1389", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "位数差太多了。", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这样的人当我的女朋友，真的可以吗？", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我开始担心会不会被女生们怨恨了。", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，对了。二年级快要期末考了吧？”", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1390", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没错，下个礼拜就是期末……”", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你有念书吗？”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1391", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“完全没有。应该说，根本没空念。”", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的脑中全部都是学姐，连一个英文单词都塞不进去。", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不想想办法的话，成绩一定会很悲惨。", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那明天和后天要不要来我家一起念书？”", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1392", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……可以吗？”", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，美羽老师会很严厉教导你的喔～”", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1393", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……这么可爱的老师是犯规吧。", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "光是“美羽老师”这个叫法，我就已经知道自己绝对念不进去了。", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么样？还是你已经有约了？”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1394", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有，我没有约。那就拜托你了，美羽老师。”", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我已经放弃期末考了。", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "周末就跟美羽老师快乐度过吧。嗯。", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“被你叫美羽老师，感觉好害羞喔。”", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1395", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还是叫你天羽老师比较好？”", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1396", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜～？”", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "pn0375", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 152, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“想被新吾君叫美羽老师♪”", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "mu1397", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 153, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "再见了，期末考……", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
